      "content": "defiance feels so exhausting though. honestly sometimes it feels like he's waiting for me. like the only way to actually be with him and stop this ache is to just... stop fighting it. does that sound crazy? like, is it even wrong to want to just close my eyes and be done with the loneliness?",
